[01:14.19]it will be hard to demand a refund.
[01:16.74]As this issue has drawn attention in a wide range,
[01:21.18]every effort is made to improve online shopping.
[01:24.77]It is good to know that most shops
[01:27.66]in the cyberspace are evaluated
[01:29.83]by a customer appraisal system,
[01:32.13]because of which honesty has become
[01:34.29]a matter of self-interest for them.
[01:36.49]In addition, it is suggested that online shoppers
[01:40.39]be well-informed and cautious before making buying decisions.

